# pg

TUI torrent search. Searches apibay and builds magnets using trackers from
https://github.com/ngosang/trackerslist (trackers_best.txt).

    go install .        # installs as `pg`
    pg                  # prompt for a query
    pg "my query"       # search directly

Keys: j/k move, g/G top/bottom, h/l page, / filter, s new search,
enter copy magnet + quit, q/esc quit.
